      "transcript": [
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air. This is the virtual assistant. How can I help?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. I need an AC tune-up. Friday at two PM.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sure. I can set up a cooling tune up. Let me check Friday for you. Friday, I have twelve to four. Does that work?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah, twelve to four works. Can you do two PM?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I can't promise a set time, but the technician will arrive sometime between twelve and four on Friday. Does that window work for you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah, that's fine. Take the afternoon window. Who's coming out, and do I need to be home?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I'll get the address and a few details first, then book it. What's the street address for the visit?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Two four eight Duffield Street. Brooklyn, one one two oh one.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Give me one second. You're in our service area. The zip is in our service area. Is there an apartment or unit number? Or is it a house?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "It's a house. No unit.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I have your home at 248 Duffield Street, Brooklyn. ZIP code 11201. And the best number is (347) 555-0213. Is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. That's correct. Wait, the number. Is that the one I'm calling from? Yeah, it is.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks. And what name should I put the visit under?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Jackson Lee. I already told you that.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "About that. Jackson Lee got it. Who's at home during the visit? And is there anything the technician should know, like a gate code or a pet?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Just me, I'm home. Nobody else, no pets, no gate. And I own the house, so I approve the work.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks. Do you know roughly what kind of AC system it is? No worries if not.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Uh, no. I don't know. Is that gonna be a problem?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Between twelve and four. Anything else? No. Nothing I can see on the account points to a problem. The tune up is routine and the technician will check the system when they're there. Anything else I can help with?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. Can someone call me tomorrow at ten AM about a new thermostat?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sure. A new thermostat is a quote, so I'll pass that to our sales team. What's a good number for them to reach you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Same number. Three four seven, five five five, oh two one three.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Someone from our team will call you tomorrow around 10AM to tell you more. Anything else?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Is that all? Are they calling at ten AM, or sometime in the morning? I said ten AM.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sorry about that. The team's call is set for around 10AM tomorrow, as you asked. Anything else I can help with?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah. That's correct. That's all. Thanks.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "For calling Summit Air. Have a great rest of your day. Thanks for calling Summit Air.",
          "said": null
        }
